Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.10,0:00:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.62,0:00:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Raising our voices we take\Nin the beautiful blue world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.84,0:00:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go get the sails all unfurled!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.80,0:00:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,La la la la la!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.08,0:00:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah yeah yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.70,0:00:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are in between\Nthe sea and the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.42,0:00:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready now for adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We're itching to try!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.92,0:00:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready to roam!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So all aboard now we're set to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.98,0:00:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Set sail to the ocean so deep!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.08,0:00:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready for a truly grand adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.30,0:00:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well don't you think\Nthat sounds really fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.82,0:00:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All this excitement is second to none!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.20,0:00:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Raising our voices we take.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.06,0:00:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,In the beautiful blue world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.30,0:00:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.18,0:00:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.92,0:01:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go get the sales all unfurled.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.26,0:01:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,La la la la la.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.04,0:01:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's something that\NI just won't ever forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.68,0:01:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the way that I felt\Nwhen our journey was set.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.26,0:01:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I won't be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.86,0:01:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I keep that feeling there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.18,0:01:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,With that, let us keep up the pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.46,0:01:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,While enjoying every\Ntrip from place to place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.04,0:01:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Our timid hearts get the rhythm ingrained.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.12,0:01:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's keep going, adventure awaits.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.58,0:01:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So many treasures await.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.88,0:01:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let's raise our voices in pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.40,0:01:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing out when they are found.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.72,0:01:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the riches in\Nhand, everybody rejoices.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.30,0:01:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Party on, cause we stand tall and proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.68,0:01:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is adventurous, be\Naware it's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.04,0:01:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's gonna be one of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And a trip goes on because.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.44,0:01:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the pirates of the mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.26,0:01:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,To the west, to the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:02:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta find my way, sail away,\Nall the way to one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.76,0:02:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring all your dreams with\Nyou, now fill the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.26,0:02:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In your heart, spread your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And believe that you can soar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let the breeze guide the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Till you're ready to start up once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're ready for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.70,0:02:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So many treasures away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let's raise our voices in pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing out when they are found.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.44,0:02:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the riches in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices, party on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.82,0:02:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we stand tall and proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.88,0:02:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.80,0:02:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.52,0:02:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A giant's corpse?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.24,0:02:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Even for a giant, that thing's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.04,0:02:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, they'll hear you! Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.20,0:02:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you're just as energetic\Nas your master, little Shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.58,0:02:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But now I am your new master.\NYet fear not for I shall
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.62,0:03:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,grant you both voice and body\Nso you may live on as a zombie
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.46,0:03:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,abandon your memories and\Nabandon your remnants of humanity
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.12,0:03:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,so you may serve me as an undying
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.58,0:03:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,soldier contract
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.96,0:03:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,completed it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.20,0:03:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,works like this Shandora you're\Nsupposed to give up all your
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.14,0:03:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,memories all the ties of your\Npast life that means we should
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.90,0:03:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,be able to eat on plates right\Nif you say that again I'm going
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.40,0:03:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,To break the plates in your knees,\Nyou're scary. Please Isidri, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.10,0:03:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Shandora is way too harsh on Dr. Hogback.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.08,0:03:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, awaken!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.68,0:03:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.06,0:03:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Your 500 years of slumber\Nhas come to an end!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.94,0:04:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The shadow is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.10,0:04:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.58,0:04:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.02,0:05:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.78,0:05:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap! We're screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.30,0:05:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He found us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.48,0:05:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you blame me for screaming?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.76,0:05:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.84,0:05:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumasi, don't tell me you were conspiring\Nwith those pirates behind my back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.28,0:05:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My soon-to-be bride, but\Nwhat are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.82,0:05:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A work of art, a masterpiece, just great!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.20,0:06:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.46,0:06:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened to my pride? Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.22,0:06:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are the pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.14,0:06:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They ran away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.26,0:06:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My super fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.44,0:06:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They're long gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.02,0:06:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back! Sanchi! Food!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.36,0:06:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.54,0:06:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's Sanchi? That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.50,0:06:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.54,0:06:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone want to explain this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.72,0:06:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,When Luffy's shadow entered\Nthat thing, it started moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.14,0:06:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,At least we know how the zombies work now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.66,0:06:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It really, it really came back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.48,0:06:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one\Nexplanation for all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.16,0:06:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That big guy must have Devil Fruit powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.46,0:06:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The first thing that giant\Nmonster said was meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.38,0:07:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That means it doesn't just have Luffy's\Nshadow, it has part of his personality, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.98,0:07:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess so, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.38,0:07:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all starting to make sense now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.66,0:07:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like with that penguin we\Nran into that was acting like Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.80,0:07:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Because even if it kills\Nme, I'll never kick a woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.98,0:07:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.08,0:07:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're saying they put\NSanji's shadow inside that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.48,0:07:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That seems to be what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.18,0:07:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And the samurai who hit us\Nwith the back of his sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.14,0:07:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All the weird stuff that's\Nhappening on this island?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.90,0:07:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all his fault, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.34,0:07:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't giving people\Na second chance at life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.88,0:07:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No one would ask for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.48,0:07:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No one would want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.10,0:07:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just playing God,\Nusing humans as puppets.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.60,0:07:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.51,0:07:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hogback is an amazing\Nman and a medical titan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.94,0:07:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.36,0:07:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not trying to save anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.32,0:07:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He lied to all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.16,0:07:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He's nothing more than another villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.32,0:07:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.18,0:08:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's not the time to get\Ndepressed over something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.04,0:08:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The only people we need to worry\Nabout are our crew members.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.54,0:08:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, but it's\Nup to us to save them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't just run and hide anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.62,0:08:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta go to wherever\Nthey're taking Luffy's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.12,0:08:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.03,0:08:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I think they said it was\Ngoing back to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.96,0:08:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,They must mean the Sunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.20,0:08:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If the same thing happened to Zoro and\NSanji, then they might be waiting there, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.16,0:08:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's most of the crew of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.38,0:08:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I still can't believe they got caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.28,0:08:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They're supposed to protect us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.74,0:08:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's the chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.16,0:08:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.26,0:08:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.58,0:08:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.24,0:08:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.76,0:08:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He's too strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.48,0:08:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well boys say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.96,0:09:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Because today I'm gonna marry her!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.26,0:09:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid. If I can't\Neven protect one woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.42,0:09:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I have no right to call myself a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.24,0:09:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this Viper star.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.14,0:09:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He's disappearing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.24,0:09:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.70,0:09:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.68,0:09:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Nami's disappearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.02,0:09:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.32,0:09:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting another smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.38,0:09:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really strong. Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.24,0:09:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.26,0:09:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't tell!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.50,0:09:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest is up to you, my loyal zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.10,0:10:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Capture the intruders and\Ndeliver them to Master Moria.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.68,0:10:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I still can't tell where he's coming from.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.18,0:10:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.18,0:10:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an armored zombie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.28,0:10:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.19,0:10:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a whole bunch of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.64,0:10:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,A bunch of zombies are\Ncoming from upstairs, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.60,0:10:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what else?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.76,0:10:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Give up your shadows already!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.76,0:10:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, Jumper, we're the heroes here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.92,0:10:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't have our shadows\Ntaken away like the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.22,0:10:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadows for our master.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.32,0:10:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Not taking zombies, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.72,0:10:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.38,0:10:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't die and there's too many of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.42,0:10:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to fight me one at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.52,0:10:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.46,0:10:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We just want your shadow, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.58,0:10:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't freak out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.38,0:11:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hold up. Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.16,0:11:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, dude, they just purified the...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.20,0:11:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your filthy rotten\Nhands off of my bros.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.62,0:11:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I ain't gonna warn you again. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.14,0:11:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,These guys know our secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.32,0:11:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.22,0:11:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.50,0:11:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, we're too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.56,0:11:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Lost Nami, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.58,0:11:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. We'll save her. Right, you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.34,0:12:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell! I don't\Nbelieve it. Someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.44,0:12:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,than that humming swordsman\Nknows our weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.76,0:12:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This sucks we can't die\Ndoesn't really work so
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.28,0:12:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,there's our motto if\Nwe're all running around
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.94,0:12:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,scared of dying we were\Ntold they used this
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.98,0:12:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,staircase to transport\Npeople whose shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.20,0:12:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,have been cut that makes sense they took
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.96,0:12:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,luffy here we were\Nheaded this way too right
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.66,0:12:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,before nami got kidnapped\NI'm so worried about
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.10,0:12:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,her do you think she'll\Nbe okay Yeah if they
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.62,0:12:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,wanted her dead they\Nwouldn't have captured
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.14,0:12:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,her by the way do you\Nhave any idea what that
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.66,0:12:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,monstrous roar was we heard earlier we
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.88,0:12:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,couldn't see anything\NYeah we were trying to see
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.74,0:12:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,where it came from but\Nthen we ran into you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.52,0:12:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That roar was loopy.\NWhat did you say? Don't
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.52,0:12:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,worry we'll tell you\Neverything we saw I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.86,0:12:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,think you're gonna like\Nwhat you hear though?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.04,0:12:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.50,0:12:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He's nowhere near done!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.20,0:12:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How much food can this special zombie eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.74,0:12:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll knock out this entire\Nisland's food supply!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.42,0:13:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.33,0:13:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's quite an impressive appetite!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.24,0:13:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumasi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.15,0:13:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you care to explain the reason\Nyou are hiding those pirates, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.52,0:13:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, see, it's your cut. Stop talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.44,0:13:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not cute at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.62,0:13:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, thanks, Onion Guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.26,0:13:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, if you're gonna feed me, get more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.88,0:13:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.42,0:13:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, this food kinda sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.06,0:13:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, special zombie! That's rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.90,0:13:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so cocky!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.34,0:13:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think he\Nmust have made me move?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.66,0:13:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That includes you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.52,0:13:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you be so rude to\Nthe ruler of Thriller Bar?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.54,0:13:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the master is pretty much\Nthe king of the island. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.48,0:13:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.68,0:13:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy over here was the one\Nwho was being a jerk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.26,0:13:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't sell out your friends like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.90,0:13:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,While you're eating, listen up, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.52,0:13:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Five hundred years ago, you were\Na notorious and legendary villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.30,0:14:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And now you have been reborn through my\Npower and will serve as my underling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.44,0:14:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Underling?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.86,0:14:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.77,0:14:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, I have a queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.48,0:14:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The audacity!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.22,0:14:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen such a zombie!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.58,0:14:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is small and stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.40,0:14:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'mma go outside for a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.14,0:14:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe I should go out to see and check\Nout the world! You? On a boat? You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.86,0:14:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.24,0:14:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, the special freezer's\Nmade of dense sealed steel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.68,0:14:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.80,0:14:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Slam your fist into it all you\Nwant, it's not gonna punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.20,0:14:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Pissed off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.56,0:14:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Wyatt!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.88,0:14:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.26,0:14:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Force is escaping!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.46,0:14:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.80,0:14:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.40,0:14:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought my arm was gonna stretch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.40,0:14:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.31,0:14:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be the king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.40,0:15:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be just like before you talk big but\Nthen you'll end up begging for your life
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.12,0:15:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,while screaming anything\Nbut the afro anything
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.02,0:15:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but the afro wrong this time is different
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.62,0:15:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't stand a chance there\Nare terrifying zombies at
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.50,0:15:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,every turn even when I summon\Nup the courage to cut them
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.64,0:15:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,down they get right back\Nup but they must have some
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.08,0:15:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,sort of weak point right at\Nthis rate even if I found the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.24,0:15:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,zombie with my shadow I\Nwouldn't be able to do anything
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.58,0:15:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,to get it back on top of that\Nzombie faces are too scary
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.58,0:15:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,whoa one of our buddies was
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.54,0:15:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,purified how'd that happen it
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.80,0:15:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,looks like it looks like he\Nate some salted grilled fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.84,0:15:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot, was he a new guy or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.78,0:15:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he say salted grilled fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.32,0:15:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.80,0:15:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the guy who shadowy\Nstole a few days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.34,0:16:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you get back here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.66,0:16:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Just answer my question.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.22,0:16:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Which of your zombies has my shadow in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.46,0:16:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't tell me, I'll\Nscatter fish all over this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.48,0:16:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Fish, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.14,0:16:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuss, fuss!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.18,0:16:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell good is that gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.14,0:16:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.34,0:16:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The only other thing it\Ncould be is the salt, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.92,0:16:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But... salt...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.24,0:16:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But what the hell good is spreading\Na bunch of salt around gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.26,0:16:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's salt!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.46,0:16:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Zombies are still scary after\Nall, especially at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.78,0:16:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness, that's the grasshopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.64,0:16:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that scared me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.22,0:16:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, it's dangerous for me when the\Nsun is up then I'd be much easier to spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.66,0:16:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! A song!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.64,0:16:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're scared, you should sing\Nsomething to take your mind off things.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.02,0:16:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if I run really fast so\NI can't see their scary faces?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.34,0:17:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and purify each one, I'll eventually\Nfind the one with my shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.92,0:17:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that creepy song all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.34,0:17:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And who's the one humming it? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.54,0:17:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.42,0:17:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.78,0:17:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.40,0:17:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The eye to the darkness of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.10,0:17:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All you hear is the humming.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.42,0:17:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A swordsman with a terrifying face is\Ngoing around killing zombies one by one,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.24,0:17:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,trying to find his shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.74,0:17:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's devastated our ranks, purifying\Nevery zombie he's come across.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.58,0:17:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.30,0:17:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mistress Verona, there's been an incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.58,0:17:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.50,0:17:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't wake me when I'm sleeping, Kumasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.36,0:17:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Nyohohohohoho!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.58,0:17:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,At last we meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.08,0:18:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he so strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.14,0:18:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought he was supposed to be me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.88,0:18:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though our swordsmanship is evenly\Nmatched, I can't keep up with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.56,0:18:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.52,0:18:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how many times you try to defeat\Nme, the outcome will always be the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.52,0:18:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think I know\Nwhat's slowing you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.98,0:18:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you let me cut off\Nthat bothersome afro of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.12,0:18:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What? No! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.44,0:18:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything but that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.64,0:18:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare even touch this afro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.60,0:18:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.51,0:18:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.90,0:18:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're my shadow, then you have to know\Nhow truly important this afro is to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.00,0:18:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of the fact that my body has stopped\Ngrowing, my afro would never grow back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.24,0:18:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I would be gone forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.54,0:18:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So, who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.04,0:18:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And though I am your shadow,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.78,0:19:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I've forgotten everything about\Nthe days we spent together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.52,0:19:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,As of now, Moria and\NAbsalom are my masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.30,0:19:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,They give the orders, not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.94,0:19:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A walking skeleton that\Ntreasures his afro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.84,0:19:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you realize how ridiculous you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.00,0:19:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.56,0:19:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, please! Not the afro! No, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.64,0:19:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything but the afro!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.04,0:19:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How pathetic you are, my former master.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.52,0:19:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that I have lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.24,0:19:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I accept defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.78,0:19:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet I beg of you, please, let me live.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.38,0:19:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll leave this island immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.64,0:19:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, get out of my sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.60,0:19:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If you were to die, it would\Nbe a problem for me as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.04,0:20:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen such a pitiful scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.52,0:20:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care what you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.10,0:20:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,During these past five years, I've been\Nthinking of nothing but this second chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.18,0:20:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've trained to become stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.72,0:20:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.04,0:20:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, good evening, Master Absalom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.24,0:20:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you gotten everything\Nin order for the ceremony?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.08,0:20:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.99,0:20:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's ready whenever you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.20,0:20:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.66,0:20:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.28,0:20:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Then start it once.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.02,0:20:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Put her in her dress and\Nbring her to the wedding hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.44,0:20:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.40,0:20:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Said this thing's bigger than a giant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.60,0:20:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, some kind of monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.18,0:21:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.28,0:21:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,that huge crash you heard and all that\Ncrazy yelling came from the same creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.42,0:21:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, Luffy Zombie\Nis going on a rampage!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.52,0:21:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.82,0:21:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.02,0:21:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.93,0:21:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's the way this works, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.22,0:21:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You land right here on the island,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.26,0:21:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,take a little stroll through\Nthis gate and up the stairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.32,0:21:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Before you know it, walk\Nstraight into the boss's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.54,0:21:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,serving him your shadow\Non a silver platter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.58,0:21:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody lowered the stairs on the sunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.74,0:21:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder why they'd do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.80,0:21:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what happened while we were\Ngone, but they totally wrecked the place!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.30,0:21:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the zombies' work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.04,0:21:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Their footprints are everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.22,0:21:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.13,0:21:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you think they're still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.24,0:22:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Joke's on them. We don't have anything\Nworth taking. I don't smell any zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.98,0:22:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So you think the others are really\Nhere won't know till we look.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.90,0:22:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, they're right up here. The dining\Nroom, all three of them, those zombies?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.78,0:22:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Really had a field day with them\Nwhile they were knocked out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.06,0:22:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look at.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.94,0:22:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Still didn't do it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.58,0:22:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So you punks want to be lazy, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.58,0:22:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.68,0:22:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Step aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.78,0:22:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm using my bazooka.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.32,0:22:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a more delicate solution
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.16,0:22:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a beautiful lady sword master with\Na whole bunch of me With meat and swords?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.94,0:22:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are helpless!
